{
  "about": "Text functions in code, alike in every runtime (texts): characters counted once however many bytes they take in UTF-8, positions from 1 as lists count. words splits on white space and drops what is empty; split keeps empty pieces, and an empty separator gives the characters; slice clamps to the text; indexOf gives 0 when the text is not there; lower and upper change ASCII, Latin-1, Latin Extended-A, Greek and Cyrillic letters, each to one letter (ß stays ß).",
